## 实战：多子节点自定义布局

以「圆形排列子节点」布局为例：

```dart
// ParentData：父节点附加在子节点上的布局信息
class CircularParentData extends ContainerBoxParentData<RenderBox> {
  double angle = 0.0;
}

class RenderCircularLayout extends RenderBox
    with ContainerRenderObjectMixin<RenderBox, CircularParentData>,
         RenderBoxContainerDefaultsMixin<RenderBox, CircularParentData> {

  double _radius;
  RenderCircularLayout({required double radius}) : _radius = radius;

  set radius(double value) {
    if (_radius == value) return;
    _radius = value;
    markNeedsLayout();
  }

  @override
  void setupParentData(RenderBox child) {
    if (child.parentData is! CircularParentData) {
      child.parentData = CircularParentData();
    }
  }

  @override
  void performLayout() {
    const childConstraints = BoxConstraints.tightFor(width: 40, height: 40);
    final children = getChildrenAsList();
    final count = children.length;

    for (int i = 0; i < count; i++) {
      final child = children[i];
      child.layout(childConstraints, parentUsesSize: true);

      // 将子节点均匀分布在圆周上
      final angle = (2 * 3.14159 / count) * i;
      final parentData = child.parentData! as CircularParentData;
      parentData.offset = Offset(
        _radius + _radius * cos(angle) - child.size.width / 2,
        _radius + _radius * sin(angle) - child.size.height / 2,
      );
    }

    size = Size(_radius * 2, _radius * 2);
  }

  @override
  void paint(PaintingContext context, Offset offset) {
    defaultPaint(context, offset);
  }

  @override
  bool hitTestChildren(BoxHitTestResult result, {required Offset position}) {
    return defaultHitTestChildren(result, position: position);
  }
}
```

---

## performLayout 约束传播规则

| 约束类型    | 含义                                                     | 常见来源                            |
| ----------- | -------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |
| `tight`     | minWidth == maxWidth，minHeight == maxHeight（强制尺寸） | `SizedBox`、`Expanded`              |
| `loose`     | min 为 0，max 有限制                                     | `Center`、`Padding`                 |
| `unbounded` | max 为无穷大                                             | `ListView`、`SingleChildScrollView` |
| `infinite`  | min 和 max 都为无穷大（不可用于 RenderBox）              | 理论上不存在                        |

**黄金规则**：父向子传递约束（从上到下），子向父报告尺寸（从下到上），父决定子的位置（存入 `parentData.offset`）。

